# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares ``start``, ``end`` and ``step`` has its point count checked against ``result_items`` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Fangster med flange:** Et værktøj hvis skema erklærer ``start``, ``end`` og ``step`` har sin pointtal kontrolleret imod ``result_items`` og afvises med det mindste trin, der passer, så opstrøms aldrig scanner et område, hvis resultat adapteren ville kassere."

