msgid "**Custom ``kix-proxy`` routing:** The role bind-mounts a complete ``default.conf`` into the upstream ``kix-proxy`` container that exposes the agent portal on port 80, routes through the frontend Node server, and forwards the OAuth2-proxy ``X-Forwarded-User`` header as a ``Remote-User`` upstream header."
msgstr "**Brugerdefineret ``kix-proxy`` routing:** Rollebind- monterer en komplet ``default.conf`` ind i opstrøms ``kix-proxy`` container, der udsætter agent portal på port 80, ruter gennem frontend Node server, og frem OAuth2- proxy ``X-Forwarded-User`` header som en ``Remote-User`` opstrøms header."

# libretranslate
