msgstr "**Opsætning** The Let 's Krypt Conquienge- and-redirect snippet fra `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**Implementering og emballage fonde.** En vært deployering mode slutter Compose og Swarm i deployering værktøj. Det første *sys- pakke*, *sys- aur* og *sys- aur- install* rollerne blev erstattet af et distributionsuafhængigt pakkeregister. Volume metadata bruger nu en kanonisk skema, single- file monts bliver Swarm configugs, og service placering, replika tæller, afhængigheder, adresser og sundhed prober løse gennem deployerings- bevidste lookups."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for ``ssh-agent``."
msgstr "**Deploys og muliggør en systemd-brugerservice** til ``ssh-agent``."

# libretranslate
