# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Advar ikke ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao holder Vault 's metriske navnerum, og en sund unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, så en advarsel om ``== 0`` Brand permanent. Anvendelse ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 under forsegling); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` bekræfter."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so an alert on `== 0` fires permanently. Use `/v1/sys/health` (503 while sealed); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` corroborates."
msgstr "**Advar ikke `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao holder Vault 's metriske navnerum, og en sund unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, så en advarsel om `== 0` Brand permanent. Anvendelse `/v1/sys/health` (503 under forsegling); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` bekræfter."

