# libretranslate
msgid "**Operating a deployment.** New make targets reach a single deployed application: *compose-app-exec*, *compose-app-logs* and *compose-app-restart*. Diagnostics collect the logs an application writes to a file, including from busybox containers. Health probes use a fast start cadence with a window that outlasts a real boot, so a slow starter is no longer reaped. The CSP health check accepts a status code a vhost declares instead of dropping the vhost, and gives onion vhosts a navigation budget Tor can meet."
msgstr "**Opererer en deployering.** Nye målemål når en enkelt anvendt applikation: *compose- app- exec*, *komposit- app- logs* og *compose- app- genstart*. Diagnostik indsamle logfiler en ansøgning skriver til en fil, herunder fra busybox containere. Health prober bruge en hurtig start kadence med et vindue, der udvarer en rigtig boot, så en langsom starter er ikke længere høstede. CSP sundhed check accepterer en statuskode en vhost erklærer i stedet for at droppe vhost, og giver løg vhosts en navigation budget Tor kan mødes."

# libretranslate
