msgstr "**Pass**: `make compose-playwright role=<role>` udgange `0` OG alle [Bidrag `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md) holder for den resulterende kørsel."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at `/openbao/policies/`, because OpenBao parses *every* file under `-config` as server configuration. Storage is `/openbao/file`, not `/openbao/data`: the image pre-chowns only `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for the non-root `openbao` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. `command:` is just `server` — the entrypoint appends `-config` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Stier, der ser forkerte ud og ikke er.** Politikker `/openbao/policies/`, fordi OpenBao parser *hver* fil under `-config` som serverkonfiguration. Opbevaring `/openbao/file`, ikke `/openbao/data`: billedet pre- chowns kun `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for non-root `openbao` bruger, så en volumen andre steder lander rodejet og tømmerflåde kan ikke skrive. `command:` er bare `server` - indgangspunktet afhænger `-config` Og at give det duplikerer flaget."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at ``/openbao/policies/``, because OpenBao parses *every* file under ``-config`` as server configuration. Storage is ``/openbao/file``, not ``/openbao/data``: the image pre-chowns only ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` for the non-root ``openbao`` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. ``command:`` is just ``server`` — the entrypoint appends ``-config`` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Stier, der ser forkerte ud og ikke er.** Politikker ``/openbao/policies/``, fordi OpenBao parser *hver* fil under ``-config`` som serverkonfiguration. Opbevaring ``/openbao/file``, ikke ``/openbao/data``: billedet pre- chowns kun ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` for non-root ``openbao`` bruger, så en volumen andre steder lander rodejet og tømmerflåde kan ikke skrive. ``command:`` er bare ``server`` - indgangspunktet afhænger ``-config`` Og at give det duplikerer flaget."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Each consumer gets a role and user scoped to its own `<entity>-*` index namespace."
msgstr "**Per- Consumer Isolation:** Hver forbruger får en rolle og bruger scoped til sin egen `<entity>-*` indeks navnerum."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Each consumer gets a role and user scoped to its own ``<entity>-*`` index namespace."
msgstr "**Per- Consumer Isolation:** Hver forbruger får en rolle og bruger scoped til sin egen ``<entity>-*`` indeks navnerum."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Issues a scoped API key per consumer, restricted to its own collection namespace."
msgstr "**Per- Consumer Isolation:** Udgiver en scoped API-nøgle per forbruger, begrænset til sin egen samling navnerum."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant has no per-user auth; each consumer is isolated by the collection-name prefix ``{entity}_``."
msgstr "**Per- Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant har ingen per- bruger auth; hver forbruger er isoleret af collection- name prefix ``{entity}_``."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant has no per-user auth; each consumer is isolated by the collection-name prefix `{entity}_`."
msgstr "**Per- Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant har ingen per- bruger auth; hver forbruger er isoleret af collection- name prefix `{entity}_`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` or `/roles/web-app-kix/user` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The `user` role is declared via `meta/rbac.yml` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**Per- app RBAC:** Medlemmer af `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` eller `/roles/web-app-kix/user` er optaget i KIX; andre brugere er blokeret ved OAuth2 proxy. Den `user` rolle er erklæret via `meta/rbac.yml` så nonadmin agenter kan få helpdesk adgang uden at støde dem til global administrator."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` or ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The ``user`` role is declared via ``meta/rbac.yml`` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**Per- app RBAC:** Medlemmer af ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` eller ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` er optaget i KIX; andre brugere er blokeret ved OAuth2 proxy. Den ``user`` rolle er erklæret via ``meta/rbac.yml`` så nonadmin agenter kan få helpdesk adgang uden at støde dem til global administrator."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer isolation:** Every consumer receives its own identity and bucket with bucket-scoped actions only."
msgstr "**Per- forbruger isolation:** Hver forbruger får sin egen identitet og spand med kun skæggede handlinger."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer virtual keys:** Each consuming application receives its own virtual key, created through the gateway admin API under an alias naming that application."
msgstr "**Per- forbruger virtuelle nøgler:** Hver forbrugende program modtager sin egen virtuelle nøgle, skabt gennem gateway admin API under et alias navngivning dette program."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync `--link-dest` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
msgstr "**Per- container snapshots:** rsync `--link-dest` snapshots kopierer uændrede filer på tværs af kørsler."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync ``--link-dest`` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
msgstr "**Per- container snapshots:** rsync ``--link-dest`` snapshots kopierer uændrede filer på tværs af kørsler."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-domain TLS via app-level override**: extra public domains under `applications.<app>.server.domains` deploy as additional HTTPS vhosts; flavor from `applications.<app>.tls.mode` (default `TLS_MODE`). `.onion` → always HTTP. No per-domain TLS map."
msgstr "**Per- domæne TLS via app- niveau override**: ekstra offentlige områder under `applications.<app>.server.domains` indsætte som yderligere HTTPS vhosts; smag fra `applications.<app>.tls.mode` (standard `TLS_MODE`). `.onion` → altid HTTP. Intet per- domæne TLS kort."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` so the caller never has to gate the role with a ``when:`` clause."
msgstr "**Per- familie afsendelse:** Ruter efter ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` så den, der ringer, behøver aldrig at åbne rollen med en ``when:`` klausul."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by `ansible_facts['distribution']` so the caller never has to gate the role with a `when:` clause."
msgstr "**Per- familie afsendelse:** Ruter efter `ansible_facts['distribution']` så den, der ringer, behøver aldrig at åbne rollen med en `when:` klausul."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-IN** on a non-swarm host: explicitly rejected. Swarm mode is exclusively triggered by group membership. The per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override only opts OUT on a swarm host, never opts IN on a non-swarm host."
msgstr "**Per- rolleopt- IN** på en ikke-sværm vært: udtrykkeligt afvist. Swarm mode udløses udelukkende af gruppemedlemskab. Per- rolle `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` Override kun opts Out på en sværm vært, aldrig opts IN på en ikke-sværm vært."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-OUT** on a swarm host: a role MAY override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` in its `vars/main.yml` to stay on the compose path even when the host is in `svc-swarm-node`. Role vars win over `group_vars/all` by Ansible precedence."
msgstr "**Per- rolleopt- Out** på en sværm vært: en rolle MAJ tilsidesætte `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` i `vars/main.yml` at blive på den komponere sti, selv når værten er i `svc-swarm-node`. Rollevars vinder over `group_vars/all` af Ansible forrang."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-round variant selection.** In round R every primary app uses variant index `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. So a single-variant app stays on variant 0 in every round, and a 3-variant app in a 5-round deploy follows `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."
msgstr "**Perrunde variant valg.** I runde R bruger hver primær app variantindeks `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. Så en single-variant app bliver på variant 0 i hver runde, og en 3-variant app i en 5-runde deployering følger `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Performance Enhancement:** Ensures adequate swap space for optimal system performance."
msgstr "**Præstationsforbedring:** Sikrer tilstrækkelig swap plads til optimal systemydelse."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Performance Optimization:** Improves overall system performance by leveraging appropriate storage media."
msgstr "**Præstationsoptimering:** Forbedrer den overordnede systemydeevne ved at udnytte passende lagringsmedier."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Performance trade‑off:** While slightly more storage might be used compared to `latin1`, the universality of `utf8mb4` outweighs the cost for most deployments."
msgstr "**Performance trade-off:** Mens lidt mere opbevaring kan anvendes i forhold til `latin1`, universaliteten af `utf8mb4` opvejer omkostningerne ved de fleste deployeringer."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Permissions:** Ensure you have the necessary permissions and rights within the Docker container to perform these actions."
msgstr "**Tilladelser:** Sørg for at have de nødvendige tilladelser og rettigheder i Docker container til at udføre disse handlinger."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persisted on the deploy target** for `INFINITO_VERSION`, written by the [sys-version](../../../roles/sys-version/) role."
msgstr "**Fastholdt på deployeringsmålet** til `INFINITO_VERSION`, skrevet af [system- version](../../../roles/sys-version/) rolle."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent Timers:** Optionally enables persistent timer behavior to ensure missed activations are handled."
msgstr "**Vedvarende timere:** Muligvis muliggør vedvarende timer adfærd for at sikre, at manglende aktiveringer håndteres."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent agent data:** Agent state is stored in a named volume mounted at `/opt/data`, which the Backup Docker Volumes service captures without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Vedvarende agentdata:** Agent state er gemt i et navngivet volumen monteret på `/opt/data`, som Backup Docker Volumes service fanger uden at stoppe containeren."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent agent data:** Agent state is stored in a named volume mounted at ``/opt/data``, which the Backup Docker Volumes service captures without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Vedvarende agentdata:** Agent state er gemt i et navngivet volumen monteret på ``/opt/data``, som Backup Docker Volumes service fanger uden at stoppe containeren."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent configuration:** Mounts `/config` as a named volume and hands it to the container backup service when volume backups are part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Vedvarende konfiguration:** Ophæng `/config` som en navngiven volumen og hænder det til containeren backup service, når volumen sikkerhedskopier er en del af deployeringen."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent configuration:** Mounts ``/config`` as a named volume and hands it to the container backup service when volume backups are part of the deployment."
msgstr "**Vedvarende konfiguration:** Ophæng ``/config`` som en navngiven volumen og hænder det til containeren backup service, når volumen sikkerhedskopier er en del af deployeringen."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent model store:** A named volume mounted at `/root/.lmstudio` keeps downloaded models and server settings across redeploys."
msgstr "**Persistent modellager:** Et navngivet volumen monteret ved `/root/.lmstudio` holder downloadede modeller og serverindstillinger på tværs af omfordelinger."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent model store:** A named volume mounted at ``/root/.lmstudio`` keeps downloaded models and server settings across redeploys."
