# libretranslate
msgid "At boot, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` runs from ``init.groovy.d`` and mints an API token named ``infinito-mcp`` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through ``sys-token-store``, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the ``mcp_authorization`` filter."
msgstr "Ved start, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` kører fra ``init.groovy.d`` og mints en API token navngivet ``infinito-mcp`` for administrator-kontoen, skrive den almindelige værdi til ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` så læser, at værdien ud af beholderen, fortsætter det gennem ``sys-token-store``, og hard- mislykkes deployeringen, når controlleren afviser det. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` vælger token op fra butikken og klientrollerne bygge hovedet via ``mcp_authorization`` filter."

# libretranslate
msgid "At boot, `files/mcp-api-token.groovy` runs from `init.groovy.d` and mints an API token named `infinito-mcp` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to `/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token`. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through `sys-token-store`, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the `mcp_authorization` filter."
msgstr "Ved start, `files/mcp-api-token.groovy` kører fra `init.groovy.d` og mints en API token navngivet `infinito-mcp` for administrator-kontoen, skrive den almindelige værdi til `/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token`. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` så læser, at værdien ud af beholderen, fortsætter det gennem `sys-token-store`, og hard- mislykkes deployeringen, når controlleren afviser det. `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` vælger token op fra butikken og klientrollerne bygge hovedet via `mcp_authorization` filter."

