msgstr "Fordi opslaget udsender ``$(...)`` shell syntaks, opkald SKAL bruge ``ansible.builtin.shell`` modul (ikke ``command``) for omgivende ``container exec`` Invacation. En følgesvend regel håndhæver dette."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same `(repository, ref)` shape as every other `meta/services.yml`, the existing `update-repository-refs` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via `git ls-remote --tags` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
msgstr "Fordi stifterne bruger det samme `(repository, ref)` Form som alle andre `meta/services.yml`, den eksisterende `update-repository-refs` CI job opdager dem på egen hånd: det løser den nyeste semver tag af hvert arkiv via `git ls-remote --tags` og åbner en pull anmodning med bump. Opgradering af en linter er derfor en revideret forpligtelse, ikke en overraskelse."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same ``(repository, ref)`` shape as every other ``meta/services.yml``, the existing ``update-repository-refs`` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via ``git ls-remote --tags`` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
