# libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Best- indsats: puppeteer browseren downloades ikke her (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) så ``install-lint`` forbliver sandbox- sikker. mmdc behøver kun en browser til RENDER, som ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` Bestemmelser om efterspørgsel (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) lige før det gør. At browser skibe som en lynlås, så ``unzip`` er sikret her (Dukketeers udtrækker har brug for det, ellers efterlader det en tom version dir og mmdc rapporter browseren mangler). En mislykket installation advarer i stedet for at afbryde ``install-lint``, så sandkasser uden npm / browser adgang stadig få resten af lint værktøjskæden."

