# libretranslate
msgid "Cached keyed on (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). A read issued while the applications render is in progress sees the unrendered tree, whose service flags are still Jinja strings; its map is cached under its own key so the render's own call sites reuse it without it ever being served as the finished map. The tor flags are rendered before they are read (``_resolved_flag``), so that mid-render map carries the same onion domains the finished one does."
msgstr "Cached keyed on (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). En læse udstedt, mens de programmer, der gør er i gang ser det ubehandlede træ, hvis service flag er stadig Jinja strenge; dens kort er cached under sin egen nøgle, så renders egne opkald sites genbruge det, uden at det nogensinde bliver tjent som det færdige kort. Tor flag er afleveret, før de bliver læst (``_resolved_flag``), så mid- render kortet bærer de samme løg domæner den færdige gør."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached value: the **list of documents** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` returns for that file. Single-document YAML files cache as a 1-element list, so a callsite that asks for the single doc (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) and a callsite that asks for the multi-doc list (``load_yaml_all``) share **the same parse**. The same list / dict instances are returned to every caller, so callers that mutate the result MUST `copy.deepcopy()` it first. Treat the value as read-only."
msgstr "Cached værdi: **Fortegnelse over dokumenter** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` returnerer for den fil. Single- document YAML filer cache som en 1-element liste, så et callsite, der beder om den enkelte doc (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) og et callsite, der beder om multi- doc listen (``load_yaml_all``) andel **samme fortolkning**. De samme liste / diktat tilfælde returneres til hver ringer, så ringer, der muterer resultatet SKAL `copy.deepcopy()` Først. Behandl værdien som read- only."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached: repeated calls for the same *role_dir* reuse the first parse. Pass an absolute path so the cache key is stable across callers that resolve relative paths differently."
msgstr "Cached: gentagne opfordringer til det samme *role_dir* Genbrug den første parse. Pass en absolut sti, så cache tasten er stabil på tværs af opkald, der løser relative stier forskelligt."

