# libretranslate
msgid "Each addon lives in its own file `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`: **the file root IS the addon spec, there is NO wrapping `<addon_id>:` key, and the filename stem supplies the addon id.** All files in the directory are collected into `applications.<role_id>.addons`, keyed by `<addon_id>`. The materialised path is `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>`, read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."
msgstr "Hver addon lever i sin egen fil `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`: **filen root IS addon spec, der er ingen indpakning `<addon_id>:` nøgle, og filnavnet stammer addon id.** Alle filer i mappen er indsamlet i `applications.<role_id>.addons`, keyed by `<addon_id>`. Den materialiserede vej er `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>`, læse via `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Each addon spec MUST guard on the addon being enabled via `skipUnlessAddonEnabled('<addon_id>')`, backed by the `ADDON_<ID>_ENABLED` flags rendered into `templates/playwright.env.j2`, and skip cleanly when it is not."
msgstr "Hver addon spec SKAL beskytte på addon bliver aktiveret via `skipUnlessAddonEnabled('<addon_id>')`, støttet af `ADDON_<ID>_ENABLED` Flag `templates/playwright.env.j2`, Og springe rent over, når det ikke er."

# libretranslate
msgid "Each agent now claims its own key in `meta/users.yml` and declares nothing about the password there, because provisioning stores one for every declared account. An earlier attempt pinned the password to a separate `identity_password` credential in `meta/secrets.yml`; that was the wrong home for it. An account password belongs to the account, and the provisioning code says so directly: a role whose registration rejects the shell-safe alphabet states that in its own `meta/users.yml` rather than carrying a second credential beside the account it already owns. The `{{ 42 | strong_password }}` that re-renders per read is the fallback for an inventory nobody provisioned, not the value a deployed account holds."
msgstr "Hver agent nu hævder sin egen nøgle i `meta/users.yml` og erklærer intet om adgangskoden der, fordi hensættelse gemmer en for hver erklæret konto. Et tidligere forsøg fast password til en separat `identity_password` credential in `meta/secrets.yml`- Det var det forkerte hjem. En konto password tilhører kontoen, og den hensættelse kode siger det direkte: en rolle, hvis registrering afviser shell- safe alfabetet siger, at i sin egen `meta/users.yml` I stedet for at bære en anden kredit ved siden af den konto, den allerede ejer. Den `{{ 42 | strong_password }}` at re-renders per read er fallback for en beholdning, ingen provied, ikke den værdi en indsat konto besidder."

# libretranslate
msgid "Each application role stays responsible for its own Playwright tests and configuration. This role only provides the execution framework."
msgstr "Hver applikationsrolle forbliver ansvarlig for sine egne Playwright test og konfiguration. Denne rolle giver kun rammerne for gennemførelsen."

