msgstr "Hver børnebog pins en Ansibel overflade; se per- mappe README for rækkevidde. Aktuelle problemer, der ikke er Ansible- specifikke (compose/docker/networks, OAuth2/ OIDC, serviceregister, role- meta layout) live under [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/), [`iam/`](../iam/), [`meta/`](../meta/), eller [`roles/`](../roles/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one IAM surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Generic OIDC-redirect URI checks and domain rules live under [`meta/domains/`](../meta/domains/); port allocations live under `tests/integration/ports/` once introduced."
msgstr "Hver børnemappe pins en IAM overflade; se per- mappe README for rækkevidde. Generisk OIDC- omdirigering URI kontrol og domæneregler lever under [`meta/domains/`](../meta/domains/); Havnefangst `tests/integration/ports/` Når introduceret."

# libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one infrastructure surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Ansible-native artefacts (filters, lookups, playbooks) live under [`ansible/`](../ansible/); IAM concerns under [`iam/`](../iam/); per-role structural rules under [`roles/`](../roles/)."
msgstr "Hver børnebog pins en infrastruktur overflade; se per- mappe README for rækkevidde. Ansible- indfødte artefakter (filtre, opslag, playbooks) live under [`ansible/`](../ansible/); IAM bekymringer under [`iam/`](../iam/); perrollestrukturregler [`roles/`](../roles/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one meta surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Per-role structural rules (`meta/main.yml`, `meta/services.yml`, includes) live under [`roles/`](../roles/); infrastructure layout lives under [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/)."
