# libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Fork [rpardini / docker- registry- proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) og undervise i bundtet nginx til at håndtere GCP Artifact Registry omdirigere URL 'er (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)I øjeblikket `gcr.io` blob træk er omgået via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` til [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), som er et arbejde omkring, der deaktiverer caching for disse registre. Langfristet: ombase opstrøms `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` regler for at anerkende den nye omdirigeringsform, sende fix i vores gaffel, punkt `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (eller dets billedmærke) ved gaflen, og slip `NO_PROXY` bypass."

# libretranslate
