msgstr "Ud over brugersikkerhedsretningslinjerne har administratorerne yderligere ansvar for at sikre hele systemet:"

# libretranslate
msgid "In all communication and when handling data, you MUST respect the [Hacker Ethics](https://www.ccc.de/de/hackerethik) as defined by the Chaos Computer Club. This means treating information responsibly, protecting privacy, and acting in the interest of the public good."
msgstr "I al kommunikation og når du håndterer data, skal du respektere [Hacker Etik](https://www.ccc.de/de/hackerethik) som defineret af Chaos Computer Club. Det betyder, at man skal behandle information ansvarligt, beskytte privatlivets fred og handle i offentlighedens interesse."

# libretranslate
msgid "In compose mode the lookup returns the empty string because docker-compose ignores `deploy.replicas`. Wrapping the emit in the `deploy:` block remains the caller's responsibility - typically `roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`."
msgstr "I komponér tilstand lookup returnerer den tomme streng, fordi docker- komponere ignorerer `deploy.replicas`. Indpakning af exit i `deploy:` blokken forbliver den kaldende persons ansvar - typisk `roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`."

# libretranslate
msgid "In embedded mode (``shared: false``) a consumer’s compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener performs no authentication, so it MUST stay confined to the consumer’s isolated compose network."
msgstr "I indlejret tilstand (``shared: false``) en forbrugers komposition stak modtager en storage- kun SeaweedFS container uden UI eller offentliggjorte havne. Det indlejrede S3 Lytter udfører ingen autentificering, så det skal forblive begrænset til forbrugerens isolerede komponentnetværk."

# libretranslate
msgid "In embedded mode (`shared: false`) a consumer's compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener performs no authentication, so it MUST stay confined to the consumer's isolated compose network."
