# libretranslate
msgid "Leave `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` and `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset to cancel every matching run, as the lifecycle events do — a closed PR and a deleted branch have no run left that deserves to survive. A fallback also mirrors whatever gates its group: `global-ci-*` cancels on every ref except `main`, so the push job carries the same `github.ref_name != 'main'` guard, while `pr-ci-*` is declared `cancel-in-progress: true` unconditionally, so the pull request job is ungated too."
msgstr "Forlad `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` og `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset at annullere hver matchende løb, som livscyklusbegivenheder gør - en lukket PR og en slettet gren har ingen køre tilbage, der fortjener at overleve. En fallback også spejle uanset gates sin gruppe: `global-ci-*` annullerer på hver dommer undtagen `main`, så push job bærer den samme `github.ref_name != 'main'` Vagt, mens `pr-ci-*` er anmeldt `cancel-in-progress: true` uden betingelser, så pull request job er ikke længere."

