# libretranslate
msgid "Only go back to `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true` if you have concrete evidence that the inventory or host stack is broken, or you intentionally need a fresh single-app baseline again."
msgstr "Gå kun tilbage til `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<roles> full_cycle=true` hvis du har konkrete beviser for, at lageret eller værten stak er brudt, eller du bevidst har brug for en frisk single- app baseline igen."

# libretranslate
msgid "Only literal `https://<host>` tokens count as external assets:"
msgstr "Kun bogstavelig `https://<host>` tokens tæller som eksterne aktiver:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Only one swarm cluster fits per worktree: the lab subnet is pinned to the worktree slot (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` in `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), so a second cluster in the same worktree fails at network creation with `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` therefore reclaims whatever holds that subnet before it starts (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`), so a cluster kept with `keep=true` survives only until the next swarm run in the same worktree. Inspect a kept cluster before starting the next run. Parallel clusters need separate worktrees (`make worktree-up`), which carry distinct lab octets and are left untouched by the reclaim; `make swarm-clean` is the deliberate exception that clears every worktree's clusters."
msgstr "Kun en sværm klynge passer pr arbejdstræ: laboratoriet subnet er fastgjort til arbejdstræet slot (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` til `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), så en anden klynge i samme worktree mislykkes ved netværksskabelse med `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` derfor reclaims hvad der indeholder denne subnet, før det starter (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`), så en klynge holdt med `keep=true` Overlever kun indtil næste sværmløb i samme arbejdstræ. Undersøg en klynge før næste kørsel. Parallelle klynger har brug for separate arbejdstræer (`make worktree-up`), som bærer forskellige lab okteter og er efterladt uberørt af requaim; `make swarm-clean` er den bevidste undtagelse, der rydder alle arbejderes klynger."

# libretranslate
msgid "Only return to `mode=reinstall` when you have concrete evidence that the inventory or the host stack itself is broken (for example DNS or network failures during the deploy)."
msgstr "Vend kun tilbage til `mode=reinstall` når du har konkrete beviser på, at lageret eller selve værten stak er brudt (for eksempel DNS eller netværksfejl under deployeringen)."

# libretranslate
