# libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Operating- system pakke ledere såsom [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) og [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) holde installeret software i synkronisering med deres opstrøms distribution datalagre. Hver enkelt skibe med en anden kommando overflade, men de alle tjener det samme mål: genopfriske indekset og opgradere hver installeret pakke på værten."

