msgid "This role deploys OpenClaw as a gateway container behind the reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Its compose service is pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host, its gateway configuration file is rendered from the role, and its state directory is kept in a persistent volume. Access is fronted by an OAuth2 proxy with Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment."
